        {
          "_type": "Expr",
          "_fields": {
            "value": {
              "_type": "Constant",
              "_fields": {
                "value": "\nrun_batch_v10_10.py\n\nBatch entrypoint for the v10_10 agentic workflow stack.\n\nResponsibilities:\n- Batch ingestion (multiple jobs / resumes) from JSONL.\n- Construct per-row ExecutionContext indirectly via main_v10_10.run_workflow.\n- Propagate Phase\u20113 knobs (HYDE, RRF, council size, correction loops, telemetry routing).\n- Ensure deterministic ordering and deterministic \"golden mode\".\n- Parallelization with safe concurrency limits.\n- Emit batch-level telemetry summary (G15\u2013G18).\n- Emit JSONL / structured outputs for downstream evaluation.\n",
                "kind": "None"
              },
              "_lineno": 1,
              "_col_offset": 0
            }
          },
          "_lineno": 1,
          "_col_offset": 0
        },
