                    "_fields": {
                      "value": "\n    Enforce safe concurrency limits and deterministic golden mode behavior.\n\n    - If golden_mode is True, we always return 1 worker.\n    - Otherwise, we clamp requested to a reasonable bound based on CPU.\n    ",
